{"schema_version":3,"catalogue_version":1,"id":"bco:9-3","provision":"BCO 9-3","book":"bco","book_name":"Book of Church Order","abbreviation":"BCO","reference":"9-3","title":"Section 9-3","supplementary":false,"canonical_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/provisions/bco/9-3/","reader_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-constitution-reader/#bco/9-3","current_text":{"html":"<p>To the office of deacon, which is spiritual in nature, shall be chosen men of spiritual character, honest repute, exemplary lives, brotherly spirit, warm sympathies, and sound judgment, conforming to the biblical requirement of chastity and sexual purity in their descriptions of themselves and in their convictions, character, and conduct.</p>","text":"To the office of deacon, which is spiritual in nature, shall be chosen men of spiritual character, honest repute, exemplary lives, brotherly spirit, warm sympathies, and sound judgment, conforming to the biblical requirement of chastity and sexual purity in their descriptions of themselves and in their convictions, character, and conduct."},"source":{"name":"PCA Constitution Reader","revision":"14d73f7e5caf1d22e0514870dd30fcc69f8165cc","edition":"Current Reader text","files":{"bco.js":"c88e552545b73fd9690de620b237895b7ea52a94bed8e95690c116bf76be8ae5","wcf.js":"1ebf9e54223f7fe4e728a3e640c833a435af825d74b5ef3d4b04687685538a0d","wlc.js":"f6977e761ea4ccc93b07fcacfd0391890cb05b42f4317d807fa293c078d9b051","wsc.js":"dd775417f7ef21e3283bacad5e6ef193c41d64d03bd5a2e8fb934ccca8cb8e53","rao.js":"49808bbb0e95abdc3b07506c87dde0d62d087851e869b49c0f1f2424986450ec"}},"input_fingerprint":"38e35af46c8cbdb12a9a00c82d72f7192575b5ec27348534148f2a834551edc4","assessment_fingerprint":"517b100d2e9006e313ab6d84d4f0f31593b77832f395383ba2227779470cd034","assessment_summary":{"status":"stale","file":"index/provision_link_adjudications.jsonl","total":11481,"expected":12454,"applied":0,"stale":11481,"unmatched":0,"unassessed":12454},"parent_id":"bco:9","childre